<h3 local-id=3D"18c90adf6aba" id=3D"THENEHEMIZER-4.3ARegraSupremadeDestina=
=C3=A7=C3=A3o(FluxoDecis=C3=B3rio)">4.3 A Regra Suprema de Destina=C3=A7=C3=
=A3o (Fluxo Decis=C3=B3rio)</h3>
<p local-id=3D"90d23e120327">Para cada produto comercializado:</p>
<p local-id=3D"691895c70380"></p>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"6a595ada-4168-4e13-90aa-31c68d3bd26d">
<li local-id=3D"396ae2cf-dfce-4aba-afba-9e6623e134fa">
<p local-id=3D"4a4acfc3324d"><strong>Verifica=C3=A7=C3=A3o de Pre=C3=A7o BD=
:</strong> Checa se a refer=C3=AAncia do produto (<code>REFPROD</code>) foi=
 encontrada no PDF correspondente ao <code>GRUPO_CLIENTE</code>.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"c740a7c2-88b7-466b-8d1a-4591014a45b9">
<p local-id=3D"6c5febcdfa2a"><strong>Defini=C3=A7=C3=A3o de Aba Destino:</s=
trong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"de355fd1-f70c-4d0b-865c-b1e6313e4279">
<li local-id=3D"252fd262-4dfb-499e-8e64-daf1c10f0381">
<p local-id=3D"66b1a6fff4d3"><strong>SE</strong> <code>VALOR_TABELADO_BD</c=
ode> existe $\rightarrow$ <code>ABA_DESTINO =3D GRUPO_CLIENTE</code>, <code=
>CONTRATO_FINAL =3D N=C2=BA CONTRATO BD</code>.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"789e81ba-2888-4368-9375-b76ba631ea08">
<p local-id=3D"32eb83c69476"><strong>SEN=C3=83O</strong> $\rightarrow$ <cod=
e>ABA_DESTINO =3D 'NORMAL'</code>, <code>CONTRATO_FINAL =3D 'NORMAL'</code>=
.</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li local-id=3D"13a48f30-c2bc-4d3d-a826-faddb47fba76">
<p local-id=3D"59c075edf5ee"><strong>Composi=C3=A7=C3=A3o do Pre=C3=A7o de =
Compra Final:</strong> $$\text{PRECO_COMPRA_FINAL} =3D \text{coalesce}(\tex=
t{VALOR_TABELADO_BD}, \text{PRECO_NORMAL}, \text{Pre=C3=A7o Editado Manualm=
ente})$$</p></li>
</ol>
<p local-id=3D"e0bdfcf7bbcc"></p>
<p local-id=3D"d8be3bbae236"></p>
<hr local-id=3D"ad3fb273-ff4e-4fab-b28b-31c1bfc89374" data-layout=3D"wide" =
data-width=3D"760">
<p local-id=3D"8d6a51ec049b"></p>
<h2 local-id=3D"874e9beb3bfc" id=3D"THENEHEMIZER-=F0=9F=93=8A5.EstruturadoA=
rquivodeSa=C3=ADda(ExcelConsolidado)">=F0=9F=93=8A 5. Estrutura do Arquivo =
de Sa=C3=ADda (Excel Consolidado)</h2>
<p local-id=3D"9daea6c264c3">O relat=C3=B3rio gerado em <code>.xlsx</code> =
possui a seguinte composi=C3=A7=C3=A3o gr=C3=A1fica e de conte=C3=BAdo:</p>
<h3 local-id=3D"3f6dccb49f1e" id=3D"THENEHEMIZER-5.1AbaRESUMO">5.1 Aba <cod=
e>RESUMO</code></h3>
<ul local-id=3D"30387e29-b8a3-42f9-91b6-15193072b9b7">
<li local-id=3D"ac0bf019-ab8f-42a5-93ae-035c2f16e4d5">
<p local-id=3D"cd874cb10b82"><strong>Cabe=C3=A7alho:</strong> Fundo Laranja=
 Saavedra (<code>#F37021</code>) com texto branco em negrito.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"b7d35158-216c-44f2-85fc-d7cb64398ed7">
<p local-id=3D"8d38d1dc1f5a"><strong>Estrutura de Colunas:</strong> <code>C=
ONTRATO</code>, <code>SIGLA/GRUPO</code>, <code>PEDIDO</code>, <code>Ref Pr=
od</code>, <code>Descri=C3=A7=C3=A3o</code>, <code>Qtd Com</code>, <code>VL=
R UNIT</code>, <code>VLR TOTAL</code>, <code>VLR UNIT COMPRA</code>, <code>=
VLR TOTAL COMPRA</code>.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"0ae3f39f-0662-466b-9114-3543d0e7fbad">
<p local-id=3D"1df99a07ab11"><strong>Subtotais Acumulados:</strong> Inser=
=C3=A7=C3=A3o de linha destacada ao final de cada grupo (<code>TOTAL ACUMUL=
ADO {destino}</code>) com soma total dos valores de venda e compra.</p></li=
>
<li local-id=3D"3adcf8a1-b2f0-4fc7-b040-1a5b2ef77c77">
<p local-id=3D"f06fbe6624f8"><strong>Formata=C3=A7=C3=A3o Monet=C3=A1ria:</=
strong> Colunas de valor formatadas em <code>R$ #,##0.00</code>.</p></li>
</ul>
<h3 local-id=3D"01bc19842327" id=3D"THENEHEMIZER-5.2AbasIndividuaisporClien=
te(UNIMED,PUC,HCPA,NORMAL,etc.)">5.2 Abas Individuais por Cliente (<code>UN=
IMED</code>, <code>PUC</code>, <code>HCPA</code>, <code>NORMAL</code>, etc.=
)</h3>
<ul local-id=3D"1e56c0bf-53d6-4126-91ed-e5018d616432">
<li local-id=3D"61f630ff-d0e3-4f55-b4bb-ca5d42e2374d">
<p local-id=3D"74e008f93798"><strong>Cabe=C3=A7alho:</strong> Fundo Grafite=
 (<code>#333333</code>) com texto branco em negrito.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"f2a9a7c6-e96f-496c-9b23-0ffa0241c7f4">
<p local-id=3D"a7db857355db"><strong>Se=C3=A7=C3=A3o Superior:</strong> Lis=
ta completa das transa=C3=A7=C3=B5es brutas contendo <code>CONTRATO</code>,=
 <code>CNPJ_PARCEIRO</code>, <code>UF</code>, <code>COD_CLI_USO</code>, <co=
de>RAZ=C3=83O SOCIAL</code>, <code>CNPJ_PARC_USO</code>, <code>CONVENIO</co=
de>, <code>Ref Prod</code>, <code>Descri=C3=A7=C3=A3o</code>, <code>Qtd</co=
de>.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"23755ccd-ea6a-4da4-ba81-494da87d4a2c">
<p local-id=3D"e186a612cab3"><strong>Se=C3=A7=C3=A3o Inferior (Tabela Resum=
o da Aba):</strong> Tabela sint=C3=A9tica consolidando <code>Ref Prod</code=
>, <code>Descri=C3=A7=C3=A3o</code>, <code>Qtd Com</code>, <code>VLR UNIT V=
ENDA</code>, <code>VLR TOTAL VENDA</code> e a linha final <code>TOTAL GERAL=
</code>.</p></li>
</ul>
<hr local-id=3D"e84792d8-519a-4176-a3de-4512177e1a60" data-layout=3D"wide" =
data-width=3D"760">
<h2 local-id=3D"10e0c1845fb7" id=3D"THENEHEMIZER-=E2=9A=99=EF=B8=8F6.Instal=
a=C3=A7=C3=A3oeSustenta=C3=A7=C3=A3oT=C3=A9cnica">=E2=9A=99=EF=B8=8F 6. Ins=
tala=C3=A7=C3=A3o e Sustenta=C3=A7=C3=A3o T=C3=A9cnica</h2>
<h3 local-id=3D"d0782887fd2e" id=3D"THENEHEMIZER-6.1RequisitosdeInfraestrut=
ura">6.1 Requisitos de Infraestrutura</h3>
<ul local-id=3D"84b74686-659e-4ca7-b72c-93e246ebfb02">
<li local-id=3D"64630d49-71db-45d7-838c-cfb87e019c83">
<p local-id=3D"c5490e4320b5"><strong>SO Compat=C3=ADvel:</strong> Windows S=
erver / Linux Ubuntu 22.04 LTS / macOS.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"b531e837-531d-458a-a54f-b70afd3d69e1">
<p local-id=3D"3931254d229c"><strong>Python:</strong> 3.11+</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"212928fd-2ff3-4987-97d8-fcaff3a693ce">
<p local-id=3D"f649e86661f6"><strong>Bibliotecas Chave:</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"8ef4b890-161e-4977-84ca-1c628417d8a1">
<li local-id=3D"2fc68a50-ee22-424c-88c8-f6cde2984d14">
<p local-id=3D"8c026f5d3095"><code>streamlit</code>: Servidor web reativo e=
 renderiza=C3=A7=C3=A3o gr=C3=A1fica.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"da5e9e5b-a976-425b-a42c-2bf7540dcc1d">
<p local-id=3D"fc953336f1d4"><code>pandas</code>: Motor de ETL e agrega=C3=
=A7=C3=A3o estat=C3=ADstica.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"1433cd00-a0db-496b-89eb-e660a426e6a1">
<p local-id=3D"e9b708c3de28"><code>pdfplumber</code>: Extra=C3=A7=C3=A3o te=
xtual e tabular de documentos PDF.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"7328cdc9-3a8f-46bc-a76b-2bdad08689d4">
<p local-id=3D"ab56fc418308"><code>xlsxwriter</code>: Formata=C3=A7=C3=A3o =
avan=C3=A7ada e gera=C3=A7=C3=A3o nativa de arquivos <code>.xlsx</code>.</p=
></li>
</ul></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"c41713b28879"></p>
<hr local-id=3D"3b1dc21a-269a-47e8-9897-96fd8da5dfc3" data-layout=3D"wide" =
data-width=3D"760">
<p local-id=3D"823d791379d1"></p>
<h2 local-id=3D"9737fa467574" id=3D"THENEHEMIZER-=E2=9D=937.Troubleshooting=
ePerguntasFrequentes(FAQ)">=E2=9D=93 7. Troubleshooting e Perguntas Frequen=
tes (FAQ)</h2>
<h3 local-id=3D"2e5a131c901a" id=3D"THENEHEMIZER-Q1:Oquefazerseumnovocontra=
toouclienteforadicionado?">Q1: O que fazer se um novo contrato ou cliente f=
or adicionado?</h3>
<p local-id=3D"1235d42e690b"><strong>R:</strong> Basta atualizar o dicion=
=C3=A1rio <code>CONTRATOS_MAPPING</code> e a fun=C3=A7=C3=A3o <code>agrupar=
_cliente</code> no arquivo <code>app.py</code> incluindo o termo identifica=
dor e o n=C3=BAmero do contrato correspondente.</p>
<h3 local-id=3D"3400d032ec1f" id=3D"THENEHEMIZER-Q2:Porqueumprodutofoiparar=
naabaNORMALemvezdaabadocliente?">Q2: Por que um produto foi parar na aba <c=
ode>NORMAL</code> em vez da aba do cliente?</h3>
<p local-id=3D"00d5f298b8b1"><strong>R:</strong> Isso ocorre quando o produ=
to vendido n=C3=A3o foi encontrado na tabela do PDF do contrato corresponde=
nte =C3=A0quele cliente. O sistema aplica a <em>Regra Suprema</em> e destin=
a o item para <code>NORMAL</code> para evitar precifica=C3=A7=C3=A3o incorr=
eta.</p>
<h3 local-id=3D"78aaba948e8d" id=3D"THENEHEMIZER-Q3:OPDFn=C3=A3oest=C3=A1ex=
traindoospre=C3=A7oscorretamente.Comoajustar?">Q3: O PDF n=C3=A3o est=C3=A1=
 extraindo os pre=C3=A7os corretamente. Como ajustar?</h3>
<p local-id=3D"bd49a77c38e8"><strong>R:</strong> Certifique-se de que o PDF=
 =C3=A9 um documento pesquis=C3=A1vel (vetorial) e n=C3=A3o uma imagem digi=
talizada. O <code>pdfplumber</code> necessita de camadas de texto edit=C3=
=A1veis para capturar a c=C3=A9lula contendo <code>"R$"</code>.</p>
<p local-id=3D"837df84aee50"></p>
<hr local-id=3D"93ad1397-a980-4d4e-96c5-a6d33024e5b4" data-layout=3D"wide" =
data-width=3D"760">
<h2 local-id=3D"150178143103" id=3D"THENEHEMIZER-=F0=9F=91=A8=E2=80=8D=F0=
