=91=A8=E2=80=8D=F0=9F=92=BB 8. INFORMA=C3=87=C3=95ES DE AUTORIA &amp; SUPOR=
TE T=C3=89CNICO</h2>
<p local-id=3D"e7e2ce0290a6">Para d=C3=BAvidas arquiteturais, solicita=C3=
=A7=C3=B5es de altera=C3=A7=C3=B5es ou suporte t=C3=A9cnico nesta solu=C3=
=A7=C3=A3o:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"ff787d0a-4a35-4bec-ba57-f07cdbab015d">
<li local-id=3D"a6d513f4-0360-4241-8c7d-35238b075cef">
<p local-id=3D"36d33189e0df"><strong>Desenvolvedor Principal:</strong> Jona=
tan Severo</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"bf838d8b-e255-4a81-9cef-88b82c7f8995">
<p local-id=3D"7d184384cbd3">=F0=9F=93=A7 <strong>E-mail de Suporte:</stron=
g> <a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"mailto:suporte.saav@saavedra.com.br" =
rel=3D"nofollow"><u>suporte.saav@saavedra.com.br</u></a></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"127cbbf5-91fb-4ebe-838b-d93ba562bffe">
<p local-id=3D"0d980a556fc1">=F0=9F=92=BC <strong>Perfil Profissional Linke=
dIn:</strong> <a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https://www.linkedin.com/i=
n/jonatanfsevero/" rel=3D"nofollow"><u>linkedin.com/in/jonatanfsevero</u></=
a></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"7061e247-e555-42fd-8f58-10b537a47ffb">
